mode is "play"
fires is 0
time limit is 5 frames
when time runs out
  mode is "over"
  fires is fires + 1
to update
  tick is 1
to draw
  if mode is "play"
    write "t {timer} f {fires}" at 2, 2 in white on hud
  if mode is "over"
    write "TIME UP f {fires}" at 30, 60 in red on hud
run game with update and draw
